OL,3,AUS says Europe should ready fuel
OL,4,Asupplies as Trump threatens diesel ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump has said he may ask
OL,7,FEuropean countries to release some of
OL,8,Ftheir diesel reserves as he mulls a ban
OL,9,Fon US exports of the fuel amid a global
OL,10,Fshortage.
OL,12,FThe comments followed his Treasury
OL,13,FSecretary Scott Bessent urging for
OL,14,FEurope to immediately ready and release
OL,15,Fsuch supplies. "American farmers,
OL,16,Ftruckers, and businesses should not be
OL,17,Fleft carrying the burden" as prices
OL,18,Fsoar, he argued.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
